# E30 PingPong, the variant commented in its Program.cs: sequential, random order, 100 000 turns: a variant of the oracles (tests/tools/csharp-ref/ref/Oracles/PingPongSeqRandom/), compared as PingPong (rules/PingPong.rules).
ignore ^$
cover all
fact trial ^Trial (\d)$
fact messages ^(\d+) msg$
fact duration ^\d+ ms$
fact rate ^\d+\.\d{3} msg/ms$
same trial seq
same messages count
same duration count
same rate count
check trial count == 5
check messages max(0) <= 10000010
check messages min(0) >= 90
